---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Terms of Service for FoodLogTrack.",
  no_index: false,
};
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose text-text">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>

    <p><strong>Last Updated: January 1, 2024</strong></p>

    <p>By using FoodLogTrack, you agree to the following terms and conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use our website.</p>

    <h2>1. Medical Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>The calculators and information provided on FoodLogTrack are for educational purposes only. They are not intended as medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult with a qualified healthcare professional before making significant changes to your diet or exercise routine.</p>

    <h2>2. Use of the Site</h2>
    <p>FoodLogTrack provides free tools and content. You agree to use these tools responsibly and not to attempt to disrupt or compromise the security of the website.</p>

    <h2>3. Accuracy of Information</h2>
    <p>While we strive to use verified, primary-sourced formulas and data, we make no warranties regarding the absolute accuracy of the results provided by our calculators. Human metabolism is complex and highly individualized.</p>

    <h2>4. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
